      "id": 14278,
      "title": "Population",
      "description": "Our World in Data builds and maintains a long-run dataset on population by country, region, and for the world, based on various sources.\n\nYou can find more information on these sources and how our time series is constructed on this page: https://ourworldindata.org/population-sources",
      "producer": "Various sources",
      "citationFull": "The long-run data on population is based on various sources, described on this page: https://ourworldindata.org/population-sources",
